[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0010","text":"唔～……\n你们俩要好好扔啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0020","text":"哎呀～，\n不过被砸到的话就算豆子也挺疼的～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0030","text":"要是受伤了的话\n我们这边也为难啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0035","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0040","text":"……\n啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0045","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0046","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0050","text":"……接招！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0060","text":"哇！　等等\n朝日！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0070","text":"你干嘛啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0080","text":"你们不好好扔的话\n那我就先动手了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0090","text":"嘿呀—！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900200_01_0100","text":"……那我也动真格的了！\n……接招！"}]
